# TrueCraft+ LITE - guide (NO JavaScript version, works on patched clients)
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§2========== TrueCraft+ LITE =========="}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eTemperature §7- 0 freezing to 100 heatstroke. Deserts burn at day, snowfields and nights freeze you. Wet clothes, rain and metal armor make it worse. Campfires, torches (even held) and lava warm you."}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eClothing §7- leather warms (snow/forest), iron conducts (colder in snow, hotter in desert), chain cools deserts, gold absorbs the sun, diamond/netherite is heavy."}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eThirst §7- stand §fIN water §7to drink (raw water may sicken you - drink near a campfire to stay safe). Eat snow for a small sip. Heavy armor and deserts drain you faster."}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eWeight §7- armor kg slows you down. Iron is heavy, leather is light."}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eCamping §7- campfire near you = warm + dry. Campfire + bed within reach = §aSafe Camp§7 (regeneration)."}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eWeather §7- rain soaks you under open sky and chills you. Weather changes naturally; control it with §f/function rain §7and §f/function clear"}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eDay/Night §7- nights are colder. The pack tracks a 20-minute cycle; resync anytime with §f/function night §7or §f/function day"}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eExploration §7- walking into new ground types (Desert/Snow/Cold Forest/Shelter/Plains) gives points and messages. §f/function exploration/spawn_ruin §7builds an abandoned camp nearby."}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§6Note: §7this LITE edition uses only functions + scoreboards (no scripts). If you can run the full edition, it has more features (biomes, ruins auto-spawn, bottled water, animals)."}]}
tellraw @s {"rawtext":[{"text":"§eTroubleshooting: §f/function lite/doctor §7(diagnosis) - §f/function setup §7(repair) - §f/function lite/hud_sidebar §f+ §f/function lite/hud_off §7(alternative HUD)"}]}
